{
  "_readme": "UK retailers NOT yet in src/lib/stores.ts, waiting to be read. Inclusion here claims nothing about a shop's window: `npm run check:retailers -- --candidates` opens each homepage, follows the shop's own Returns/Refunds links, and writes the sentences that state a period to store/retailer-check/<date>-candidates.md. A shop moves into stores.ts only by hand, from those quotes, with its row and its returns page added to retailer-sources.json together. `commonWord` marks a name that is also an ordinary word, which the paste parser must not take as the shop without a cue (see pickStore). Marketplaces (eBay, Etsy, Vinted, Not On The High Street) are left out on purpose: the window is the seller's, not the site's.",
